DATA AND THIRD-PARTY CONTENT

This license covers the source code in this repository only.

Parliamentary records (including Senate Hansard, committee transcripts,
Estimates programs, questions on notice, and tabled documents) are typically
© Commonwealth of Australia. Many Hansard and related parliamentary materials
are published under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivs
(CC BY-NC-ND) or equivalent parliamentary terms.

You must:

  * attribute the Commonwealth / Parliament of Australia as the source of
    official records;
  * treat reuse of official Hansard as research / non-commercial unless you
    have confirmed a more permissive licence for a specific item;
  * not present fixture or sample text in this repository as official Hansard.

Fixture text shipped under data/fixtures/ is invented sample dialogue for
offline development. It is not a parliamentary transcript.

See README.md for attribution wording and source links.
